  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In the open beta devs are treating HUD and UI as seemingly the same thing. They are two distinct concepts. UI is for accessing functions, which you only need when you need it. HUD is for information you need always, not buttons you can press for convenience.\n\nMic indicator for HUD. The rest should be hidden for immersion/presentation reasons, and only displays when Esc is pressed.\n\nUI design does not mean shoving anything you can think of into a corner. It is the opposite and be extremely selective of what you show and not show.",
